WEBVTT

00:01:27.496 --> 00:01:31.496
sneaking inside the informatics
of a nuclear warship

00:01:31.496 --> 00:01:33.079
from an enemy country.

00:01:33.079 --> 00:01:36.829
This attack leads to the attack
of a nuclear-aircraft carrier

00:01:36.829 --> 00:01:41.163
that was barely prevented
from killing thousands of civilians.

00:01:41.163 --> 00:01:42.413
To defend itself,

00:01:42.413 --> 00:01:46.163
the enemy country responds by
unleashing a defensive cyberattack

00:01:46.163 --> 00:01:49.871
that causes the breakdown of the power 
grids of allied nations.

00:01:49.871 --> 00:01:52.038
Hospitals can
no longer treat patients,

00:01:52.038 --> 00:01:54.954
whole regions are
without heating nor clean water,

00:01:54.954 --> 00:01:58.788
which, in the end, causes dozens
thousands of civilian deaths.

00:01:59.246 --> 00:02:02.204
The origin of the power failure
was the counterattack,